      "mergeID": "66a3b555b8781ecbf23fc9f9",
      "mergedPostDetails": "The grab sensitivity is too high, reminiscent of \"light\" grab mode on the old input system. Going into the SteamVR control bindings to adjust the grab and release threshold doesn't seem to affect it though.\n\nEDIT: Further testing, this seems to only apply to the VRChat Main Menu. Updated title to reflect that.\n\nEDIT EDIT: Okay figured it out. Disregard this canny.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Main Menu Grab Sensitivity is too high / can't be altered",
      "parentID": "66a1fb391ab59b32baebc454",
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "66a2c133fd998adc8bd4869a",
