      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The `main` control bindings are separate from `menu`, just in case you were wondering. You need to know the difference.\n\n- `main` refers to the normal controls in Worlds. The Grab behavior here only affects pickups.\n\n- `menu` refers to the VRChat Main Menu. The Grab behavior here only affects the Main Menu.\n\nWhen looking at the Layers listed above, the `grab` sensitivity is controlled completely separately. Editing the Grab behavior in `main` will not affect the `menu`, so you need to adjust them both separately.\n\nRemember that SteamVR has an awful Bindings UI, so navigate with patience and care.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
