      "mergeID": "66a7b0e2984cbad35359fd06",
      "mergedPostDetails": "The default menu grabbing sensitivity feels way too high now, with Index controllers (haven't tried other controllers). It's very easy to accidentally grab the menu, and makes keyboard/chatbox typing very hard for me in particular.\n\nI've heard that there are settings to adjust the sensitivity, which is fine, but the default sensitivity could definitely be lowered to match more of what it feels like on Live.\n\nVirtual Desktop 1.32.10 beta\n\nQuest Pro w/ Index Controllers",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1481] Menu grabbing too sensitive with Index controllers",
